Package: iQualityR.doe
Title: Design of Experiments for iQualityR
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Provides comprehensive design of experiments tools, including
  factorial designs, response surface methodology, Taguchi methods,
  Bayesian optimization, multi-response optimization, and DOE-related
  visualizations and reporting.
